# {Module Name} Workflow

**FR:** [FR-{###}](../../../../docs/1-requirements/FR-{###}-{name}.md)

## Overview

Data and process flows for {module-name}.

## Data Flow

```
┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐
│  Input   │───▶│ Validate │───▶│ Process  │───▶│  Output  │
│  {type}  │    │  Schema  │    │  Logic   │    │  {type}  │
└──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────┘
                     │                               │
                     ▼                               ▼
                ┌──────────┐                   ┌──────────┐
                │  Error   │                   │  Store   │
                │ Response │                   │ {target} │
                └──────────┘                   └──────────┘
```

### Input Stage

- Source: {describe the input source}
- Format: `{InputType}` defined in `{module}-common`
- Validation rules: {describe validation}

### Processing Stage

- Business logic resides in `{module}-core`
- Transformations applied: {list key transformations}
- Side effects: {describe any side effects}

### Output Stage

- Destination: {describe the output target}
- Format: `{OutputType}` defined in `{module}-common`

## Process Lifecycle

```
┌────────────┐
│  Created   │
└─────┬──────┘
      │ initialize()
      ▼
┌────────────┐
│   Ready    │◀──────────────┐
└─────┬──────┘               │
      │ start()              │ reset()
      ▼                      │
┌────────────┐          ┌────┴───────┐
│  Running   │─────────▶│  Stopped   │
└─────┬──────┘  stop()  └────────────┘
      │ complete()
      ▼
┌────────────┐
│ Completed  │
└────────────┘
```

### State Transitions

| From | To | Trigger | Guard |
|------|----|---------|-------|
| Created | Ready | `initialize()` | Config is valid |
| Ready | Running | `start()` | Dependencies available |
| Running | Stopped | `stop()` | None |
| Running | Completed | `complete()` | All work done |
| Stopped | Ready | `reset()` | None |

## Pipeline Stages

| Stage | Responsibility | Input | Output |
|-------|---------------|-------|--------|
| {stage_1} | {description} | `{InputType}` | `{IntermediateType}` |
| {stage_2} | {description} | `{IntermediateType}` | `{OutputType}` |

## Error Propagation

```
{module}-spi error
    └──▶ wrapped as {Module}Error::{Variant}
         └──▶ propagated through {module}-core
              └──▶ returned from facade to caller
```

